====================================================
Welcome to the YukiOS Live Installation Environment!
====================================================

To launch the graphical Calamares installer:
  - Click 'Install YukiOS' on the desktop, OR
  - Run: sudo calamares (or yukios-calamares)

For terminal installation:
  - Run: yukios-installer

Network:
  - Ethernet connects automatically via NetworkManager.
  - For Wi-Fi: use 'nmcli dev wifi connect <SSID> password <PASS>'
    or the system tray network icon.
